# AI Video Recipe Generator — Walkthrough

## What Was Built

A premium **AI Video Recipe Generator** feature integrated into the existing Flask AI Recipe Generator app. After any recipe is generated (or loaded from the Recipe Book), users can click **🎥 Generate Cooking Video** to create a downloadable narrated MP4 cooking tutorial — 100% locally, using Gemini free tier for text only.

