## Pipeline Architecture

```
User clicks 🎥 Generate Cooking Video
        ↓
POST /video/generate  { food_name, ingredients, recipe_steps, language }
        ↓ returns job_id
        ↓
Background Thread: VideoRecipeGenerator.generate_video()
  ├─ 5–20%:  Gemini → per-step narration script
  ├─ 22–40%: edge-tts → per-step MP3 audio files
  ├─ 42–65%: Pillow → per-step 1080×1920 slide PNGs
  └─ 68–95%: MoviePy → assembled H.264 MP4
        ↓
GET /video/progress/<job_id>  [SSE stream → live progress bar]
        ↓ auto-redirect on completion
GET /video/result/<job_id>    [video player + download]
```

