## Feature Highlights

- **6 languages**: English (AriaNeural), Malayalam (SobhanaNeural), Hindi (SwaraNeural), Tamil (PallaviNeural), Telugu (ShrutiNeural), Kannada (SapnaNeural)
- **1080×1920 portrait** slides (Instagram Reels / YouTube Shorts ready)
- **Ken Burns zoom** + **fade-in/out** transitions via MoviePy
- **Step-duration sync**: each slide plays for exactly as long as its TTS audio
- **SSE live progress**: no polling, no page refreshes — push updates
- **Confetti animation** on video result page
- **Guest users**: videos stored 7 days then auto-cleaned
- **Recipe Book users**: video path persisted to database, shown in recipe detail
- **Future-ready**: avatar overlay, AI images, social export via single-method extensions

