## Known Behaviour Notes

- Video generation takes **~3 minutes** for a typical 5-step recipe (mostly MoviePy rendering)
- If the Flask server restarts, in-memory job state is lost — navigating back to an old `/video/result/<job_id>` will show "Still cooking…" and auto-refresh. Users should download immediately after generation.
- FFmpeg is bundled with `imageio-ffmpeg` (installed as MoviePy dependency), so no manual FFmpeg installation is required on Windows.
